{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the captain of an adventuring company\u2014yet due to a single mission, a single conspiracy, you were framed as the assassin of a royal minister. Your power was stripped away, and your companions were slaughtered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the edge of despair, a spirit from beyond this world saved you. Through the power of <strong>Leviathan Crystals</strong>, you gained the ability to cross time itself. You and your surviving allies escaped with your lives, only to become fugitives hunted across the kingdom. By a twist of fate, you learned that to reclaim your power, save your comrades, save the kingdom\u2014and perhaps the world\u2014you must reach the capital and uncover the ancient secret buried within the Leviathan Crystal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/e1d0454289c49e0bc83b94934f82de3b.avif?t=1774250359\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras_big/e1d0454289c49e0bc83b94934f82de3b.webp?t=1774250359 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fight alongside four companions, each bearing their own gifts. Together, you survived countless calamities\u2014again and again, trust was the blade that carved a path through death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/178541da9b21d8b63622ccfdf55bdc72.poster.avif?t=1774250359\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/178541da9b21d8b63622ccfdf55bdc72.webm?t=1774250359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/178541da9b21d8b63622ccfdf55bdc72.mp4?t=1774250359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though the cataclysm shattered much of their strength, they still march beside you with their first sparks of power and their unyielding resolve. Fortune, however cruel, has not abandoned you entirely. Every desperate battle, every event woven by fate, will allow them to reclaim their lost powers\u2014and awaken new ones long dormant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/88c0dad9caeaf53caefd844fba735fab.poster.avif?t=1774250359\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/88c0dad9caeaf53caefd844fba735fab.webm?t=1774250359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/88c0dad9caeaf53caefd844fba735fab.mp4?t=1774250359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each companion wields an <strong>independent</strong> pool of at least <strong>75 cards</strong>, supported by unique mechanics and limitless potential for growth. And you\u2014will be their guide, leading them to unlock every last fragment of their destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/f0537dd4d748c7e14d11b83e91c07380.poster.avif?t=1774250359\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/f0537dd4d748c7e14d11b83e91c07380.webm?t=1774250359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/f0537dd4d748c7e14d11b83e91c07380.mp4?t=1774250359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/b09010fc097fcae7e9c6c7d4b8fff432.avif?t=1774250359\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras_big/b09010fc097fcae7e9c6c7d4b8fff432.webp?t=1774250359 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside trusted comrades, another presence walks this perilous road: the <strong>Spirits</strong>\u2014keepers of the balance of time, who crossed worlds to repair the raging temporal tides. Scattered around the capital, the spirits are trapped by chaos. You must rescue them, mend the fractured timeline, and send them home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/5e78b929708b616c6c6d70a2578626dd.avif?t=1774250359\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras_big/5e78b929708b616c6c6d70a2578626dd.webp?t=1774250359 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the distortion of time, your allies\u2019 power cannot stabilize\u2014only under a spirit\u2019s protection can it endure. These spirits defend your party, and even take shape as your <strong>draw pile and discard pile</strong>, binding themselves to every battle you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/4a6e99a367ecf48a7d540929b3886b11.poster.avif?t=1774250359\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/4a6e99a367ecf48a7d540929b3886b11.webm?t=1774250359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/4a6e99a367ecf48a7d540929b3886b11.mp4?t=1774250359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect them in combat; wield their gifts when fate demands its price. Every spirit carries a unique power. You must <strong>choose the one best suited for battle</strong>, letting them become the hand that turns destiny itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/73c51e25803131be8f2a47ed534cd172.avif?t=1774250359\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras_big/73c51e25803131be8f2a47ed534cd172.webp?t=1774250359 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunted, despised, cornered\u2014you walk a land where every face may hide dagger or salvation. Countless factions clash in secret, and you cannot know friend from foe. To survive, to save your companions, to save the world, you must learn, bargain\u2014and deceive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/3d87c519095283a66d40504f9cfb2877.avif?t=1774250359\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras_big/3d87c519095283a66d40504f9cfb2877.webp?t=1774250359 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Again and again the wheel of fate turns, and you stand before destiny itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Then\u2014once more.</strong><br><br><strong>This time\u2014will you rewrite the destiny?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3697650?t=1774250359","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3697650?t=1774250359","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/1a174afbcb1067c4e0d0c76511cc36d54be818ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774250359","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/1a174afbcb1067c4e0d0c76511cc36d54be818ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774250359","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the captain of an adventuring company\u2014yet due to a single mission, a single conspiracy, you were framed as the assassin of a royal minister. Your power was stripped away, and your companions were slaughtered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the edge of despair, a spirit from beyond this world saved you. Through the power of <strong>Leviathan Crystals</strong>, you gained the ability to cross time itself. You and your surviving allies escaped with your lives, only to become fugitives hunted across the kingdom. By a twist of fate, you learned that to reclaim your power, save your comrades, save the kingdom\u2014and perhaps the world\u2014you must reach the capital and uncover the ancient secret buried within the Leviathan Crystal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/e1d0454289c49e0bc83b94934f82de3b.avif?t=1774250359\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras_big/e1d0454289c49e0bc83b94934f82de3b.webp?t=1774250359 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fight alongside four companions, each bearing their own gifts. Together, you survived countless calamities\u2014again and again, trust was the blade that carved a path through death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/178541da9b21d8b63622ccfdf55bdc72.poster.avif?t=1774250359\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/178541da9b21d8b63622ccfdf55bdc72.webm?t=1774250359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/178541da9b21d8b63622ccfdf55bdc72.mp4?t=1774250359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though the cataclysm shattered much of their strength, they still march beside you with their first sparks of power and their unyielding resolve. Fortune, however cruel, has not abandoned you entirely. Every desperate battle, every event woven by fate, will allow them to reclaim their lost powers\u2014and awaken new ones long dormant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/88c0dad9cae