tself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/73c51e25803131be8f2a47ed534cd172.avif?t=1774250359\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras_big/73c51e25803131be8f2a47ed534cd172.webp?t=1774250359 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunted, despised, cornered\u2014you walk a land where every face may hide dagger or salvation. Countless factions clash in secret, and you cannot know friend from foe. To survive, to save your companions, to save the world, you must learn, bargain\u2014and deceive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras/3d87c519095283a66d40504f9cfb2877.avif?t=1774250359\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/extras_big/3d87c519095283a66d40504f9cfb2877.webp?t=1774250359 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Again and again the wheel of fate turns, and you stand before destiny itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Then\u2014once more.</strong><br><br><strong>This time\u2014will you rewrite the destiny?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","developers":["Jump Out of Box"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697650/c932e9615974c4c7ec5196a49f77e9cf4392f018/header.jpg?t=1774250359","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3697650/575668302/5fe8ea70714b063295823d0333d0a4cfb3e62139/1769456939/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769459272","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/s